2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] checksum. Should be:
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] const foundTrack = decodeAddressByte(nibbles[i + 3], nibbles[i + 4]);
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] const foundSector = decodeAddressByte(nibbles[i + 5], nibbles[i + 6]);
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 3. Return type mismatch
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] function decodeDos33Sector(...): Uint8Array[] | null {
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash]     const result=[];
