2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] You're pushing objects `{track, sector, j, bytes}`, not `Uint8Array`. Define an interface:
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-01 17:46:40 [deepseek-v4-flash] interface DecodedSector {
