2026-08-01 17:46:41 [deepseek-v4-flash] interleaved. Just double-check the indexing when `k + 86` exceeds 341 — it won't here because `k <
2026-08-01 17:46:41 [deepseek-v4-flash] 256`, max `k+86 = 341`. Good.
