2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - PAL C64 expects 50Hz raster interrupts, not this frequency
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5] 2. Actual C64 timing:
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - CPU clock: ~985kHz (PAL)
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - Raster lines: 312 per frame @ 50Hz
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - Cycles per line: ~63 cycles
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - Raster interrupt every ~63 cycles (per line), not every `333/12=27.75` cycles
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-03 13:38:54 [claude-haiku-4-5] 3. CIA vs VIC interrupt confusion:
