2026-08-04 18:41:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-04 18:41:43 [claude-haiku-4-5]    const midiInputs = new Map<number, Deno.UnsafePointer>();
2026-08-04 18:41:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-04 18:41:43 [claude-haiku-4-5]    This is more idiomatic for dynamic key-value storage and gives you better methods (`has()`,
2026-08-04 18:41:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] `delete()`, iteration).
2026-08-04 18:41:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
