2026-08-05 09:51:27 [claude-haiku-4-5] • ATARI 9-PIN* — Paddle inputs (A, B on pins 5, 6):
2026-08-05 09:51:27 [claude-haiku-4-5] - These are typically RC timer inputs (like Apple II's `C064-C067`)
2026-08-05 09:51:27 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Will need PIO state machines or interrupt-driven ADC timing to measure paddle resistance
2026-08-05 09:51:27 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Button on pin 9 is straightforward digital input
