2026-08-05 09:51:27 [claude-haiku-4-5] - GP0 (pin 12 SDA) and GP1 (pin 15 SCL) means your display detection shares pins with PS/2
2026-08-05 09:51:27 [claude-haiku-4-5] - This could create contention if both are active — worth documenting which mode is primary
2026-08-05 09:51:27 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
