2026-08-05 17:40:08 [claude-haiku-4-5] 2. Multi-platform architecture - Clean dispatch for Apple, Commodore, Atari systems
2026-08-05 17:40:08 [claude-haiku-4-5] 3. I/O handling - Good separation of concerns for device-specific reads/writes
2026-08-05 17:40:08 [claude-haiku-4-5] 4. Audio/cassette simulation - CassetteRecorder class with WAV file support is
2026-08-05 17:40:08 [claude-haiku-4-5] well-designed
2026-08-05 17:40:08 [claude-haiku-4-5] 5. Display rendering - Multiple rendering modes (text, graphics, hires, wide characters)
