2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] The Issue
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] The code only handles 16KB (0x3FFF mask) in `ramBank`, but the Plus/4's actual banking
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] scheme switches larger blocks.
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] Plus/4 Actual Architecture
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] The Plus/4 (similar to C16) uses two 16KB banks that can be switched:
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] ╭───────────────────┬────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────╮
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  Address Range    │  ROM Mode              │  RAM Mode                 │
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] ├───────────────────┼────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  $0000–$3FFF      │  RAM (lower)           │  RAM (lower)              │
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  **$4000–$7FFF**  │  **TED ROM/Basic**     │  **Switchable RAM Bank**  │
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  **$8000–$BFFF**  │  **Cartridge/KERNAL**  │  **Switchable RAM Bank**  │
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  $C000–$FFFF      │  RAM (always)          │  RAM (always)             │
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] ╰───────────────────┴────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────╯
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] So the control register `FF3F` (enable RAM) switches two 16KB blocks (4000–7FFF and
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 8000–BFFF), not just one.
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] Current Code Problems
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 1. `ramBank` is only 8KB but should handle switching 4000–7FFF AND 8000–BFFF (32KB total
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] needed)
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 2. No actual switching logic — setting `ramBanked=true/false` doesn't redirect reads/writes
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 3. `readTED()` doesn't implement the ROM/RAM selection
2026-08-05 17:44:48 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
