2026-08-07 10:07:34 [claude-haiku-4-5] - spec 1: 1 byte, 3 cycles → Stack (PHA, PHP)
2026-08-07 10:07:34 [claude-haiku-4-5] - spec 2: 1 byte, 4 cycles → Stack (PLA, PLP)
