2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] 3. Schema Completeness Check (against `mos6502.json`)
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] 
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] To bring the 6800 spec up to full feature parity with your 6502 JSON spec, the following top-level
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] fields can be added:
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] 
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] 1. `addressmode`: Define 6800 addressing modes (e.g., `Inherent`, `Immediate`, `Direct` /
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] `Zero Page`, `Extended`, `Indexed,X`, `Relative`).
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] 2. `flags`: Define 6800 Condition Code Register bits (`["C", "V", "Z", "N", "I", "H"]`).
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] 3. `flagNames`: `["carry", "overflow", "zero", "negative", "interrupt", "half-carry"]`.
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] 4. `interrupts`: Vector map for 6800 (`IRQ`: `FFF8`, `SWI`: `FFFA`, `NMI`: `FFFC`, `RESET`:
2026-08-13 07:53:10 [gemini-3.6-flash] `FFFE`).
