2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] Z80 Addressing Modes
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] The Zilog Z80 supports ten addressing modes, as documented in the official Z80 CPU User Manual.
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 1. Immediate
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] An 8-bit constant follows the opcode.
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD A, n        ; load constant n into accumulator
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD B, 3Ch
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 2. Immediate Extended
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] A 16-bit constant follows the opcode (low byte first).
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD BC, nn      ; load 16-bit constant into BC
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD HL, 1234h
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 3. Modified Page Zero
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] Used only by the `RST` instruction, which calls a fixed address in the first 256 bytes of memory
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] (00h, 08h, 10h, … 38h).
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] RST 10h        ; call address 0010h
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 4. Relative
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] An 8-bit signed displacement (addressed from the next instruction) is added to the PC. Used by
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] `JR`.
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] JR e           ; e = -128..+127
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] JR NZ, label
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 5. Extended
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] A full 16-bit absolute address follows the opcode.
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD A, (nnnn)   ; load A from address nnnn
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] JP nnnn
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 6. Indexed
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] Uses the IX or IY register plus an 8-bit signed displacement.
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:47 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
