2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 8. Register Indirect
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] The operand address is held in a register pair: BC, DE, HL, SP, IX, or IY.
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
