2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD A, (BC)
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD A, (DE)
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD A, (HL)
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] LD (HL), n
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] PUSH BC        ; SP-based indirect access
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 9. Implied
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] The instruction implicitly defines the operand — usually the accumulator or stack pointer.
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] CPL            ; complement A (implied)
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] DI / EI        ; interrupt controls
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] DAA
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 10. Bit Addressing
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] Operates on a specific bit of an 8-bit value; the bit number is encoded in the opcode.
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
