2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] • Notes:*
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] - `LD A, (HL)` is sometimes grouped under Register Indirect, while `LD A, (IX+d)` is
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] Indexed.
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] - A few textbooks merge Implied with Register or merge Modified Page Zero
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] into Immediate/Extended, so you may see "8 modes" or "9 modes" in some references. The ten
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] above are the canonical Zilog classification.
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] - The original Z80 lacked Indexed for some operations (e.g., no `JP (IX+d)`), a limitation
2026-08-13 08:36:48 [deepseek-v4-flash] addressed in the Z180/eZ80 descendants.
