2026-08-13 09:27:56 [deepseek-v4-flash] The `ADC` entry now uses the `forms` array, which matches the masked‑opcode idea we discussed:
2026-08-13 09:27:56 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-08-13 09:27:56 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
