2026-08-16 07:41:29 [glm-5.2] is preserved). It updates Zero (Z), Half-Carry (H), and Parity/Overflow (P/V). Sign (S) is
2026-08-16 07:41:29 [glm-5.2] technically set to an unknown state, but is often grouped as affected in documentation. I have used
2026-08-16 07:41:29 [glm-5.2] `"ZHP"` here to represent the flags it actively updates, but you can adjust this to match your
