2026-08-16 07:51:00 [glm-5.2] Also, regarding cycles: unconditional `CALL` always takes 17 cycles. Conditional `CALL`
2026-08-16 07:51:00 [glm-5.2] instructions (like `CALL NZ, nn`) take 17 cycles if the condition is met (the jump happens), but
