2026-08-16 14:07:35 [glm-5.2] mapping you may want something like `0xBA` (OEM_1) or a dedicated code, since `0xDF` is rarely
2026-08-16 14:07:35 [glm-5.2] produced by typical keyboards.
2026-08-16 14:07:35 [glm-5.2] - Row 7, col 7 is `0x03` (VK_CANCEL/Break). RESTORE on the C64 isn't actually part of the
