2026-08-17 09:17:54 [nitro@ryzen5] does ctrl affect other vkeys???
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.1 gemini-3.7-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.003 12.42KB 1.89s
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] • No, the Control key does not change the Virtual-Key (VK) codes of other keys.*
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] In the Windows input model:
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 1. VK Codes are Physical Identifiers:
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    When you press `Ctrl + C`, the system emits two distinct events:
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * Event 1: `VK_CONTROL` (`0x11`) or `VK_LCONTROL` (`0xA2`)
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * Event 2: `0x43` (VK code for `'C'`)
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    The VK code for `'C'` remains `0x43` regardless of whether Control, Shift, or Alt is held down.
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 2. Character Codes (ASCII) Do Change:
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    While the VK code stays the same, the resulting character translation (e.g., `WM_CHAR`
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] or text input) changes into non-printable ASCII control characters:
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * Pressing `'A'` generates character code `65` (`'A'`) or `97` (`'a'`).
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * Pressing `Ctrl + A` generates character code `1` (`0x01`, SOH).
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * Pressing `Ctrl + C` generates character code `3` (`0x03`, ETX).
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] Summary for Keyboard Emulation:
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] If you are matching host key presses to your VIC-20 keyboard matrix using VK codes
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] (`keydown` / `WM_KEYDOWN`), modifier keys like `Ctrl` will not alter the codes received for other
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] keys.
2026-08-17 09:17:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
