2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 1. Matrix Wiring Row/Column Transposition
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] The standard VIC-20 hardware matrix (VIA #1 Port B / VIA #2 Port A) places modifier keys in
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] specific slots:
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Left Shift is located at Row 4, Column 1 in the matrix (wired alongside `Z, C, B,
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] M, .`). In your current array, it is placed in Row 3 with `X, V, N`.
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Right Shift is located at Row 3, Column 6 (wired alongside `X, V, N, ,, /`). In
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] your current array, it is placed in Row 4 with `Z, C, B, M`.
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Commodore Key (C=) is located at Row 5, Column 0 (wired alongside `S, F, H, K,
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] :`).
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] • RUN/STOP is located at Row 3, Column 0 (currently set to `0x00`).
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 2. Physical Placement of Modifiers on Host Keyboards
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] When emulating a Commodore machine on a modern PC keyboard, using `0xA2` (Left Control) for
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] the Commodore Key creates a conflict if you also want to use the VIC-20's `CTRL` key.
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] Common PC mappings:
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] • VIC-20 `CTRL` Key \rightarrow mapped to Left Ctrl (`0xA2`) or generic
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] `VK_CONTROL` (`0x11`) at Row 2, Column 0 (currently `0x70` / F1).
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] • VIC-20 `C=` Key \rightarrow mapped to Left Alt / Menu (`0xA4` / `VK_LMENU`) or
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] Left Windows (`0x5B` / `VK_LWIN`) at Row 5, Column 0.
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] • VIC-20 `RUN/STOP` Key \rightarrow mapped to ESC (`0x1B`) or Pause/Break
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] (`0x13`) at Row 3, Column 0.
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:06 [gemini-3.7-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
