2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.1 gemini-3.7-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.009 18.29KB 4.46s
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] The Commodore VIC-20 does have a physical `CTRL` key.
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] Physical Location
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] On the VIC-20 keyboard, the `CTRL` key is located on the far-left edge, directly to the
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] left of the `Q` key.
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] What the `CTRL` Key Does on the VIC-20
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 1. Changing Text Colors:
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    Holding `CTRL` while pressing number keys `1` through `8` changes the text color in direct mode
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] or inside strings:
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `1` = Black
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `2` = White
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `3` = Red
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `4` = Cyan
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `5` = Purple
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `6` = Green
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `7` = Blue
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * `CTRL` + `8` = Yellow
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:20:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 2. Reverse Video:
