2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] bits are permanently set to `1`.
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] The bit layout from most significant bit (Bit 7) to least significant bit (Bit 0) is as follows:
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] ╭─────────┬──────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  Bit    │  Symbol  │  Name            │  Description                                                                             │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] ├─────────┼──────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  :---   │  :---:   │  :---            │  :---                                                                                    │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **7**  │  `1`     │  —               │  Permanently set to logic `1`                                                            │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **6**  │  `1`     │  —               │  Permanently set to logic `1`                                                            │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **5**  │  **H**   │  Half-Carry      │  Set if a carry occurred from bit 3 to bit 4 during an addition (used for BCD / `DAA`).  │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **4**  │  **I**   │  Interrupt Mask  │  When set (`1`), maskable interrupts (`IRQ`) are disabled.                               │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **3**  │  **N**   │  Negative        │  Set if the most significant bit (bit 7) of the result is `1`.                           │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **2**  │  **Z**   │  Zero            │  Set if the result of an operation is equal to `0`.                                      │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **1**  │  **V**   │  Overflow        │  Set if a two's complement arithmetic overflow occurs.                                   │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **0**  │  **C**   │  Carry / Borrow  │  Set if a carry or borrow occurred out of bit 7 during an arithmetic operation.          │
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] ╰─────────┴──────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
2026-08-17 09:57:20 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
