2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] FD3F: LDA $E810       ; Read PIA1_PA
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] FD42: BPL $FD44       ; Diagnostic pin test (Bit 7)
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] FD44: CLI             ; Enable IRQ processing
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] FD45: JMP $E0D2       ; Jump to BASIC cold start
