2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Bit 7 Sense (`FD3F`): Reads `PIA1_PA`. On real hardware, pin 7 connects to the diagnostic
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] line on the user port / cassette. If grounded (`0`), the PET boots directly into diagnostic monitor
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] ROM; since it returned `FF` (bit 7 = 1), it proceeds to normal initialization.
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Enable Interrupts (`$FD44`): `CLI` unmasks IRQs, allowing the 60 Hz timer interrupts to
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] begin firing.
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Hand-off to BASIC (`FD45`): Jumps to `E0D2` to start the Microsoft BASIC cold
2026-08-18 17:48:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] initialization.
