2026-08-18 18:00:29 [gemini-3.7-flash] from `0400` upward by writing `92`, reading it back, shifting it (`ASL`), writing `24`, and reading
2026-08-18 18:00:29 [gemini-3.7-flash] it back to find the upper limit of installed RAM (stopping before `8000` video RAM or when writes
2026-08-18 18:00:29 [gemini-3.7-flash] fail to read back).
