2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] At `$E840`, the PET is testing the Horizontal/Vertical Video Retrace (Blanking) Signal to
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] prevent "video snow" (screen flicker/sparkles).
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] The Code Breakdown
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] E7AD: LDA $E840       ; Read VIA_ORB (MOS 6522 Port B Data Register)
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] E7B0: AND #$20        ; Mask Bit 5 (%00100000)
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] E7B2: BNE $E7B4       ; Wait/check loop for retrace
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] E7B4: TYA             ; Restore character
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] E7B5: LDY $E2         ; Cursor column
2026-08-18 18:15:11 [gemini-3.7-flash] E7B7: STA ($E0),Y     ; Write character directly to Screen RAM ($8000+)
