2026-08-18 18:18:48 [gemini-3.7-flash] 1. Timing Specifications (60 Hz NTSC Standard PET)
2026-08-18 18:18:48 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Master Clock: 1 MHz (1 cycle = 1\ μ\texts)
2026-08-18 18:18:48 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Line Duration: 64 cycles per line (15.625\text kHz)
2026-08-18 18:18:48 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Visible Line: \approx 40\text–44 cycles / Horizontal Blanking: \approx 20\text–24
2026-08-18 18:18:48 [gemini-3.7-flash] cycles
2026-08-18 18:18:48 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Frame Duration: \approx 16,666 cycles (260 lines total)
2026-08-18 18:18:48 [gemini-3.7-flash] • Vertical Blanking: Last \approx 60 lines (\approx 3,840 cycles)
