2026-08-18 18:18:49 [gemini-3.7-flash] 3. Integrating into the Memory Read Handler
2026-08-18 18:18:49 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 18:18:49 [gemini-3.7-flash] In `readPET()`, reflect the blanking state on Bit 5 (`0x20`) of `VIA_ORB` (`0xE840`):
