2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] • The Commodore PET Kernal ROM's `SCNKEY` routine evaluates Port B (`$E812`) using active-low
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] logic:
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash]   * `0xFF`: No keys pressed on the selected column.
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash]   * Any bit cleared (`0`): Key pressed on that row line.
