2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] the column scan loop.
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] 2. Early Return in `writePET` at `$E810`
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] In `writePET`:
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] case 0xE810:
