2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] • When `cra & 4` is true (directing writes to Port A Output Register / PRA rather than Data
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] Direction Register A), the function executes `scanKeyboard(...)` and exits early with `return;`.
