2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] • When Bit 2 of `CRA` (`E811`) is `1`, reads and writes to `E810` target the Peripheral
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] Output/Input Register (`PRA`).
2026-08-19 08:26:24 [gemini-3.7-flash] • In `readPET`, reading `$E810` currently returns `0xFF` unconditionally rather than returning
