2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] 3. Edge Cases to Keep in Mind
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] 1. `PHP` Stack Byte (Bit 5):
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * On NMOS 6502, `PHP` pushes `ST | 0x30` (both bit 4 Break and bit 5 Unused are pushed as `1`).
