2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] 2. Page Boundary Crossing Cycles on Writes:
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * In `targetAbsoluteX()`, extra cycle penalties are counted on page crossings. On genuine 6502
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] hardware, instructions that perform a read before write (e.g., `INC`, `DEC`, `ASL`, `ROR`) or plain
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] stores (`STA abs,X`) always take the maximum cycles regardless of whether a page boundary is
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] crossed.
2026-08-19 17:35:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] 3. Decimal Mode Flag Setting (`ADC` / `SBC`):
