2026-08-19 17:56:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  :---          │  :---:  │  :---                                                                                                        │
2026-08-19 17:56:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **Bit 0**     │  `1`    │  **Enable CB1 Interrupt (IRQ)** — triggers on screen refresh / vertical retrace.                             │
2026-08-19 17:56:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **Bit 1**     │  `0`    │  **CB1 Active Edge** — low-to-high transition detection.                                                     │
2026-08-19 17:56:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **Bit 2**     │  `1`    │  **Port B Access Mode** — directs `$E812` reads/writes to **PRB** (Keyboard column lines) rather than DDRB.  │
2026-08-19 17:56:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **Bits 3–5**  │  `110`  │  **CB2 Output Control** — Cassette motor line / diagnostics handshake.                                       │
2026-08-19 17:56:28 [gemini-3.7-flash] │  **Bits 6–7**  │  `00`   │  Read-only interrupt flags (cleared when writing).                                                           │
