2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] On every vertical blank interrupt (~50/60 Hz), your trace log should output a burst resembling:
2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] [PET] scanning column 0
2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] [PET] scanning column 1
2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] [PET] scanning column 2
2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] ...
2026-08-19 17:58:04 [gemini-3.7-flash] [PET] scanning column 9
