2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] On the Commodore PET keyboard matrix (specifically the 2001/3000 series "chicklet" and graphics
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] keyboards), row 2 begins with Q.
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] The 8 keys read across row 2 (columns 0 through 7) are:
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 1. Q — Virtual Key: `81` (`0x51`)
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 2. E — Virtual Key: `69` (`0x45`)
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 3. T — Virtual Key: `84` (`0x54`)
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 4. U — Virtual Key: `85` (`0x55`)
