2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] to `186` (standard browser semicolon/caret depending on layout) or `38` (VK_UP). If mapping to
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] ASCII/character keys, `94` is often used.
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 7. Keypad 7 — Virtual Key: `103` (`0x67` / `VK_NUMPAD7`) or standard `'7'` (`55`)
2026-08-19 18:26:55 [gemini-3.7-flash] 8. Keypad 1 — Virtual Key: `97` (`0x61` / `VK_NUMPAD1`) or standard `'1'` (`49`)
