2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] Breakdown of True Ranges
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] • `0xFD00` – `0xFDDF`: ACIA (`FD00`), SPI User Port (`FD10`), Expansion/Speech (`FD20`),
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] and Banking latches (`FDD0–$FDDF`).
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] • `0xFF00` – `0xFF3F`: Primary TED registers (`FF00–FF1F`), Register mirrors (`FF20–FF3D`),
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] and ROM/RAM configuration strobes (`FF3E–FF3F`).
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] All other addresses in the `F000–FFFF` block (namely `F000–FCFF`, `FDE0–FEFF`, and `FF40–FFFF`) map
2026-08-20 10:54:56 [gemini-3.7-flash] to RAM during write cycles.
