2026-08-20 11:18:59 [gemini-3.7-flash]    * Writing any value to `FF3F` must set `ROM_ENABLED = false` (all reads & writes map to RAM,
2026-08-20 11:18:59 [gemini-3.7-flash] except `FD00–FDDF` and `FF00–$FF3F` which remain I/O).
