2026-08-27 15:28:56 [glm-5.3-flash] calls or widening the signature would keep intent clear. Similarly `stringDigits(num, tenGlyphs)`
2026-08-27 15:28:56 [glm-5.3-flash] assumes `num < 100` and the name suggests tens-glyphs rather than digit-glyphs.
