2026-08-29 17:08:44 [gemini-3.7-flash] Thank you for sharing the files. Here are a few notable observations regarding the setup:
2026-08-29 17:08:44 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-29 17:08:44 [gemini-3.7-flash] 1. Type Mismatch in JSON-RPC Response Serialization (`onPacket`)
2026-08-29 17:08:44 [gemini-3.7-flash]    In the diagnostics network script, `response` is defined as a `Dictionary`, and then passed
2026-08-29 17:08:44 [gemini-3.7-flash] directly to `client.send_text(response)`. `WebSocketPeer.send_text()` expects a `String`.
2026-08-29 17:08:44 [gemini-3.7-flash] Converting the dictionary to a string (such as with `JSON.stringify(response)`) before transmission
2026-08-29 17:08:44 [gemini-3.7-flash] will prevent a runtime type error.
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] 2. JSON Parsing Guard
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash]    If a client sends an empty payload or malformed string, `JSON.parse_string(message)` will return
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] `null` (or a non-dictionary variant). Checking that the parsed result is a valid `Dictionary` prior
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] to calling `.get("id", null)` helps avoid potential runtime exceptions.
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] 3. Multiple Script Declarations in a Single Listing
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash]    The GDScript snippet contains both `extends Node` and `extends Node3D` within the same block. In
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] Godot, these need to reside in separate `.gd` files or be attached to distinct nodes in your scene
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] tree.
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] 4. TypeScript Client Structure
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash]    The client cleanly matches the server's expected port (`8080`) and initiates a well-formed
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] JSON-RPC 2.0 `init` handshake on connection with automatic reconnection handling.
2026-08-29 17:08:45 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
